        "date": "2026-10-28T08:35:13Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(plugin-manager): keep the check's diagnostic honest and off the answer\n\nReview fixes for the GitHub connection check: the returned packageResult\nno longer carries the check's command line (it stays a module-local field\nof the streamed run), and the recorded line drops URL user information\nwhile Git still runs the address as typed. A check the deadline stopped\nrecords the coerced status 1 in the result because an exit code is a\nnumber, while its streamed run reports none; the JSDoc, package README\nand boot subsystem page now say exactly that.",
